    {
      "run": 4,
      "steps": 12,
      "narrative": "I've been spending my time on a small, cramped ship, exploring its cramped spaces. I started in the galley, where I found a kettle on the floor. I picked it up, examined it, and took it with me, only to take it again later when I realized I still had it. From there, I headed north to the store, where I found a coil of rope on the floor and took that as well. I then went east up a staircase to a landing, where I found a brass key on the floor and picked that up too.\n\nAs I look back, it's clear that I've been a bit of a wanderer, moving from one space to the next, taking whatever objects I find along the way. I'm not really sure what I'm doing or where I'm going, but I've got a kettle, a coil of rope, and a brass key to my name, so I suppose that's something.",
